<title>CANADA: Canada real return bond yields median 4.720 pct.</title>
<headline>Canada real return bond yields median 4.720 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Government of Canada said its C$400 million auction of 4.25 percent real return bonds due December 1, 2026 produced the following results:</p>
<p>		YIELD	 PRICE</p>
<p>    MED     4.720	   N/A</p>
<p>    LOW     4.650	   N/A</p>
<p>    HIGH    4.785	91.489  Allotment ratio 96.87500</p>
<p>The bonds will be dated and delivered on September 6. The outstanding debt of the issue totals C$1.45 billion. Bids from primary dealers totalled C$833.25 million, including C$31 million non-competitive tenders at the allotment yield.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
